From b5063e19db81c905bbb9fe2d347c81385e0cf816 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Ping CHNG <jack.ping.chng@linux.intel.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2020 14:47:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-282: DPM uses dev hashing for swdev bridge list
 instead of name

- Replaced device name with dev pointer to save memory and
  speed during hashing
- Code cleanup
---
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_misc.c     |   6 +-
 drivers/net/datapath/dpm/datapath_notifier.c |   5 +-
